  "result": "Perfect! All 53 tests pass. I've successfully added two new functions to src/invoices.js:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`:**\n- Adds a new line to the invoice, or increases qty if that SKU already exists\n- Validates qty is a positive integer (QTY_INVALID)\n- Validates SKU exists in catalogue (UNKNOWN_SKU)\n- Refuses to modify non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) without mutating the original\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`:**\n- Removes the line with the given SKU from the invoice\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if that SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n- Refuses to modify non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Returns ok(newInvoice) without mutating the original\n\n**Added error codes:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on the invoice.\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: Only draft invoices can be modified.\n\n**12 new tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and increasing qty on existing SKU\n- All validation errors (QTY_INVALID, UNKNOWN_SKU, NOT_DRAFT)\n- Removing lines (single line, first line in multi-line invoice)\n- Error cases (LINE_NOT_FOUND, NO_LINES, NOT_DRAFT)\n- Immutability for both functions\n\nAll 53 tests pass.",
